      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14281/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bacon in a large, deep skillet. Cook over medium-high heat until crisp and evenly browned, 8 to 10 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate and crumble when cool enough to handle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/97_QB7hfW5Hd8VqUelMUMrulqu0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14281-bodacious-broccoli-salad-DDMFS-step-02-f005ceda66c1495c8e609ee302c2412e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14281/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine bacon, broccoli, cheese, and onion in a large salad bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pkYRT-kyEv2qXhezpleRsPr-wzM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14281-bodacious-broccoli-salad-DDMFS-step-03-8c6c08756c014bc3a4e1a9ef4322e26b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14281/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk mayonnaise, red wine vinegar, sugar, pepper, salt, and lemon juice together in a small bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3zNA09H0A8hzK3lurDWazmFJXsI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14281-bodacious-broccoli-salad-DDMFS-step-04-4184db00f4c642e4b097c02b0d97aea4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14281/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over salad and toss well until broccoli is coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1ZWY1BdDj5IwRA8A_9bOTRaKN0k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14281-bodacious-broccoli-salad-DDMFS-step-05-6b3d67c4372545f1abe3ecc092986569.jpg"
